{"id":"level-up-2026-10-18","name":"2026-10-18 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1501","en":"She was conscious of the audience watching her every movement.","zh":"她意识到观众正看着她的每一个动作。","note":"conscious · 自觉的； 意识到的； 神志清醒的 · conscious of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1502","en":"The receipt confirms that the transaction was completed yesterday.","zh":"收据证实这笔交易已于昨天完成。","note":"transaction · 办理；处理；交易，业务； · a completed transaction","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1503","en":"The article examines one company's domination of the local market.","zh":"这篇文章考察了一家公司对当地市场的支配。","note":"domination · 控制， 统治， 支配 · market domination","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1504","en":"He received a teaching assistantship to help fund his postgraduate studies.","zh":"他获得了助教资助，帮助支付研究生学习费用。","note":"assistantship · 半工半读助学金， 研究生助教奖学金 · a teaching assistantship","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1505","en":"The office can certify a copy of your original certificate.","zh":"办公室可以认证你的证书原件的复印件。","note":"certify · 证明， 保证 · certify a copy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1506","en":"The exhibition explores architectural modernism through drawings and photographs.","zh":"这个展览通过图纸和照片探索建筑现代主义。","note":"modernism · 现代主义 · architectural modernism","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1507","en":"They prepared a nutritious meal using beans and fresh vegetables.","zh":"他们用豆类和新鲜蔬菜做了一顿营养丰富的饭菜。","note":"nutritious · 有营养的， 营养丰富的 · a nutritious meal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1508","en":"My sister plays the violin in the local youth orchestra.","zh":"妹妹在当地青年管弦乐团拉小提琴。","note":"orchestra · 管弦乐队 · a youth orchestra","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1509","en":"We do not yet have sufficient evidence to support that explanation.","zh":"我们目前还没有足够的证据支持那种解释。","note":"sufficient · 足够的， 充分的 · sufficient evidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1510","en":"Relentless rain forced the organisers to abandon the outdoor performance.","zh":"持续不断的雨迫使主办方取消了户外演出。","note":"relentless · 无情的， 残酷的 · relentless rain","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1511","en":"You can claim a refund if the concert is cancelled.","zh":"如果音乐会取消，你可以申请退款。","note":"claim · 要求；声称，主张；索赔；要求； 主张， 断言； 索赔 · claim a refund","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1512","en":"The proposal received widespread support from parents and teachers.","zh":"这项提议获得了家长和教师的广泛支持。","note":"widespread · 分布广的； 普遍的 · widespread support","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1513","en":"An antique clock stood on the shelf above the fireplace.","zh":"壁炉上方的架子上摆着一座古董钟。","note":"antique · 古时的，古老的；古物， 古董 · an antique clock","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1514","en":"The library faces a chronic shortage of space for new books.","zh":"图书馆长期缺乏存放新书的空间。","note":"chronic · 慢性的； 积习难改的 · a chronic shortage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1515","en":"Fasten the lid securely before carrying the box downstairs.","zh":"把箱子搬下楼之前，要把盖子扣牢。","note":"fasten · 扎牢， 扣住 · fasten securely","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1516","en":"As a city dweller, she rarely experienced truly silent nights.","zh":"作为城市居民，她很少体验到真正寂静的夜晚。","note":"dweller · 居住者， 居民 · a city dweller","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1517","en":"The museum documents the history of commercial whaling in the region.","zh":"博物馆记录了该地区商业捕鲸的历史。","note":"whaling · 捕鲸 · commercial whaling","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1518","en":"Inspectors discovered toxic waste near the abandoned industrial site.","zh":"检查人员在废弃工业场地附近发现了有毒废物。","note":"toxic · 有毒的； 中毒的 · toxic waste","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1519","en":"She tried not to clench her fists during the tense discussion.","zh":"紧张的讨论中，她尽量不握紧拳头。","note":"clench · 握紧； 咬紧； 牢牢抓住 · clench a fist","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1520","en":"Finding an affordable venue was our first major hurdle.","zh":"找到负担得起的场地是我们的第一大障碍。","note":"hurdle · 障碍； · a major hurdle","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1521","en":"Her letters reveal an unconquerable spirit despite years of hardship.","zh":"她的信展现了虽历经多年困苦却不屈不挠的精神。","note":"unconquerable · 不可征服的 · an unconquerable spirit","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1522","en":"The final meeting was a mere formality after everyone agreed.","zh":"大家都同意后，最后一次会议只是走个程序。","note":"formality · 认真遵循规范、 礼节等； 例行公事； 正式手续 · a mere formality","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1523","en":"The exhibition helped rekindle his interest in landscape painting.","zh":"这次展览帮助他重新燃起了对风景画的兴趣。","note":"rekindle · 重新点燃； 使复苏 · rekindle an interest","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1524","en":"You can personalize the notebook with a short message.","zh":"你可以在笔记本上写一句简短留言，使它更具个人特色。","note":"personalize · 使成为私人的； 在上标出主人姓名； 个人化 · personalize a gift","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1525","en":"The lamp costs thirty pounds plus a small delivery charge.","zh":"这盏灯售价三十英镑，另加一小笔配送费。","note":"plus · 比所示数量多的；加上；和，以及；加号；正号 · plus delivery","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1526","en":"The school's rapid expansion created an urgent need for classrooms.","zh":"学校快速扩张，迫切需要更多教室。","note":"expansion · 扩大， 扩张 · rapid expansion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1527","en":"He kept his fishing license in a waterproof pocket.","zh":"他把钓鱼许可证放在一个防水口袋里。","note":"license · 许可，执照；批准， 准许 · a fishing license","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1528","en":"The museum hopes to expand its collection of local photographs.","zh":"博物馆希望扩大其当地照片的收藏。","note":"expand · 膨胀， 扩张； 张开， 展开； 详述 · expand a collection","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1529","en":"Our training session took place at the company's headquarters.","zh":"我们的培训在公司总部进行。","note":"headquarters · 总部， 总公司； 大本营； 司令部 · company headquarters","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1530","en":"An adjustable bookrest kept the recipe visible while I cooked.","zh":"做饭时，可调节书架让食谱保持在我看得见的位置。","note":"bookrest · 阅书架 · an adjustable bookrest","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1531","en":"A low fence follows the perimeter of the school grounds.","zh":"一道低矮的围栏围着学校用地的边界。","note":"perimeter · 周长； 周边 · the perimeter of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1532","en":"His prediction of a late arrival proved surprisingly accurate.","zh":"他关于会迟到的预测竟然相当准确。","note":"prediction · 预言， 预料， 预报 · an accurate prediction","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1533","en":"Students must write an essay comparing two historical sources.","zh":"学生必须写一篇比较两份历史资料的文章。","note":"essay · 短文， 文章； 评论文 · write an essay","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1534","en":"We plan to conduct a survey of local transport needs.","zh":"我们计划调查当地的交通需求。","note":"survey · 调查， 勘察； 测量， 勘测； 审视；调查， 检视； 测量， 勘测； 俯瞰， 眺望 · conduct a survey","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1535","en":"The closure had a devastating impact on the small community.","zh":"这次关闭对这个小社区造成了毁灭性的打击。","note":"devastating · 毁灭性的； 强有力的 · a devastating impact","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1536","en":"We had to postpone the meeting because several members were absent.","zh":"由于几位成员缺席，我们不得不推迟会议。","note":"postpone · 延迟， 延期 · postpone a meeting","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1537","en":"Her appointment with the internist was moved to Friday morning.","zh":"她与内科医生的预约改到了周五上午。","note":"internist · 内科医师 · consult an internist","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1538","en":"The gardens remain a lasting legacy of the town's founder.","zh":"这些花园是小镇创始人留下的长久遗产。","note":"legacy · 遗产； 遗赠 · a lasting legacy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1539","en":"Enter the security code before opening the storage room.","zh":"打开储藏室之前，请输入安全码。","note":"code · 密码；代码；把…编码 · a security code","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1540","en":"The proposed dam could displace residents from several small villages.","zh":"拟建的水坝可能迫使几个小村庄的居民迁离家园。","note":"displace · 取代； 迫使离开家园； 撤职， 使失业 · displace residents","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1541","en":"She is passionate about preserving the village's traditional crafts.","zh":"她热衷于保护这个村庄的传统工艺。","note":"passionate · 充满激情的， 热切的， 狂热的 · passionate about","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1542","en":"Repeated interruptions proved counterproductive when the team needed to concentrate.","zh":"当团队需要集中精力时，反复打断只会适得其反。","note":"counterproductive · 产生相反效果的， 适得其反的 · prove counterproductive","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1543","en":"Please seal the envelope before handing it to the receptionist.","zh":"请把信封封好，再交给前台接待员。","note":"seal · 封， · seal an envelope","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1544","en":"The children pulled a wooden sledge up the snowy hill.","zh":"孩子们把木雪橇拖上了积雪的山坡。","note":"sledge · 乘雪橇；雪橇 · a wooden sledge","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1545","en":"The manager promised to investigate our complaint about the noise.","zh":"经理承诺调查我们对噪声的投诉。","note":"investigate · 调查 · investigate a complaint","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1546","en":"She repaired a loose seam on her favourite jacket.","zh":"她修补了最喜欢的夹克上一处松开的接缝。","note":"seam · 缝， 接缝； 煤层 · a loose seam","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1547","en":"The striped walls create an optical illusion of greater height.","zh":"条纹墙面营造出空间更高的视觉错觉。","note":"illusion · 幻想中的事物， 错误的观念； 错觉， 幻觉， 假象 · an optical illusion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1548","en":"Restoring the old photographs required considerable effort and patience.","zh":"修复那些老照片需要付出大量精力和耐心。","note":"considerable · 相当大的， 可观的； 值得考虑的， 重要的 · considerable effort","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1549","en":"The lecture explained how researchers identified a particular bacterial toxin.","zh":"讲座解释了研究人员如何识别出一种特定的细菌毒素。","note":"toxin · 毒素， 毒质 · a bacterial toxin","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:s1550","en":"Clearer instructions helped improve productivity in the packing department.","zh":"更清晰的指示帮助包装部门提高了生产效率。","note":"productivity · 生产力； 生产率 · improve productivity","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:w1501","en":"conscious","zh":"自觉的； 意识到的； 神志清醒的","note":"英 /'kɒnʃəs/ · 美 /'kɑnʃəs/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1501-uk-2a667f687fe9.mp3","text":"conscious"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1501-us-fb62f409c917.mp3","text":"conscious"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:w1502","en":"transaction","zh":"办理；处理；交易，业务；","note":"英 /træn'zækʃn/ · 美 /træn'zækʃən/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1502-uk-0560dee28e99.mp3","text":"transaction"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1502-us-831dd5f7c93a.mp3","text":"transaction"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-18:w1503","en":"domination","zh":"控制， 统治， 支配","note":"英 /ˌdɒmɪ'neɪʃn/ · 美 /,dɑmə'neʃən/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1503-uk-da310a7